  - `c2BBVerts(out: &mut [c2v], bb: &c2AABB)` -> should become `(out: *mut c2v, bb: *const c2AABB)` 
  - `c2GJKSimplexMetric(s: &c2Simplex)` -> `(s: *const c2Simplex)`
  - `c22(s: &mut c2Simplex)` and `c23(s: &mut c2Simplex)` -> `(s: *mut c2Simplex)`
  - `c2D(s: &c2Simplex)` -> `(s: *const c2Simplex)`
  - `c2Support(verts: &[c2v], count: c_int, d: c2v)` -> `(verts: *const c2v, count: c_int, d: c2v)`
  - `c2Witness(s: &c2Simplex, a: &mut c2v, b: &mut c2v)` -> `(s: *const c2Simplex, a: *mut c2v, b: *mut c2v)`
  - `c2L(s: &c2Simplex)` -> `(s: *const c2Simplex)`
  - `c2Norms(verts: &[c2v], norms: &mut [c2v], count: c_int)` -> `(verts: *const c2v, norms: *mut c2v, count: c_int)`
  - `c2PlaneAt(p: &c2Poly, i: c_int)` -> `(p: *const c2Poly, i: c_int)`
  - `c2Collide(A: *const u8, typeA: C2_TYPE, B: *const u8, typeB: C2_TYPE, m: &mut c2Manifold)` -> m becomes `*mut c2Manifold`
  - `c2CircletoCircleManifold(A: c2Circle, B: c2Circle, m: &mut c2Manifold)` -> m becomes `*mut c2Manifold`
  - Same for all other manifold functions - the `m: &mut c2Manifold` parameter becomes `m: *mut c2Manifold`
